/* MARK: - Setting titles and descriptions */
"Turns the driver on or off." = "打开或关闭驱动。";
"Open at Login" = "登录时打开";
"Starts TouchMyMac when you log in, so the touchscreen works right away." = "登录时启动 TouchMyMac，触摸屏开机就能用。";
"Assign Mouse Events to" = "把鼠标事件分配给";
"Specifies which screen should receive the touch events." = "指定哪块屏幕接收触摸事件。";
"Secondary Click" = "辅助点按";
"Tap the screen with two fingers at once to secondary click at the first finger, like on a Mac trackpad." = "两根手指同时轻点屏幕，在第一根手指的位置辅助点按（右键），和 Mac 触控板一样。";
"Magnification" = "缩放";
"Pinch two fingers to increase or decrease the size of the content. (EXPERIMENTAL)" = "双指捏合来放大或缩小内容。（实验性）";
"Three-Finger Swipe Up" = "三指上滑";
"Swipe up with three fingers to open Mission Control." = "三指上滑打开调度中心。";
"Drag Controls Directly" = "直接拖动控件";
"Sliders, scroll bars, dividers, window title bars and windows in Mission Control follow your finger right away. Elsewhere, dragging scrolls unless you hold still first." = "滑块、滚动条、分割线、窗口标题栏和调度中心里的窗口会立刻跟随手指。其他地方拖动是滚动，除非先按住不动。";
"Small Target Assist" = "小目标辅助";
"A finger that lands a little beside a divider or a window's edge or corner still grabs it, and the top of a window drags it in apps that don't report a title bar. In Mission Control, desktops show their close buttons while your finger is on them." = "手指落在分割线、窗口边缘或角落旁边一点也能抓住；不报告标题栏的应用里，拖动窗口顶部可以移动窗口。在调度中心里，手指放在桌面上时会显示桌面的关闭按钮。";
"Three-Finger Swipe Left / Right" = "三指左右轻扫";
"Swipe left or right with three fingers to move between spaces and full-screen apps." = "三指左右轻扫，在桌面空间和全屏 App 之间切换。";
"Four-Finger Swipe Up Keyboard" = "四指上滑呼出键盘";
"Swipe up with four fingers to show the floating keyboard, and swipe down with four fingers to hide it." = "四指上滑显示浮动键盘，四指下滑隐藏它。";
"Five-Finger Hold Shortcut" = "五指按住快捷键";
"Hold five fingers still to keep a shortcut chord pressed. Example: fn or cmd+shift." = "五根手指按住不动，保持一组快捷键按下。例如：fn 或 cmd+shift。";
"Four-Finger Left Swipe Sequence" = "四指左滑按键序列";
"Swipe left with four fingers to fire a shortcut sequence. Example: cmd+a, delete." = "四指左滑，依次触发一串快捷键。例如：cmd+a, delete。";
"Example: fn or cmd+shift" = "例如：fn 或 cmd+shift";
"Example: cmd+a, delete" = "例如：cmd+a, delete";
"Hold Duration" = "按住时长";
"Hold a finger still this long to press the mouse button. Then move to drag, for example to select text or move files." = "手指按住不动这么久，就会按下鼠标键。之后移动手指就是拖拽，比如选文字、拖文件。";
"Double Click Zone" = "双击范围";
"How many mm can two taps be apart from each other to qualify double click" = "两次轻点相距多少毫米以内算作双击";
"Ignore Origin Touches" = "忽略原点触摸";
"If your touchscreen randomly sends coordinate (0,0) in its datastream, toggle this option to make input more stable." = "如果你的触摸屏会随机发出坐标 (0,0)，打开这个选项可以让输入更稳定。";
"Error Resistance" = "容错";
"If your touchscreen is really unreliable at reporting touches, increase this slider to make inputs more stable at the cost of higher latency in detecting liftoffs." = "如果你的触摸屏上报触摸很不稳定，把这个滑块调大可以让输入更稳，代价是判断抬手会更慢。";
"Hide Pointer While Scrolling" = "滚动时隐藏指针";
"Scrolling leaves the pointer where it was, so it's hidden while your finger scrolls." = "滚动时指针不会跟着动，所以手指滚动期间把它隐藏。";
"Scroll Inertia" = "滚动惯性";
"Keeps scrolling for a short time after you lift your finger (iPad-like)." = "抬起手指后继续滚动一小段（像 iPad 一样）。";
"Scroll Speed" = "滚动速度";
"Scales regular one-finger drag scrolling. Higher values scroll faster for the same finger travel." = "调整单指拖动滚动的倍率。数值越大，同样的手指距离滚得越快。";
"Decay Speed" = "衰减速度";
"Higher values decay slower; lower values decay faster." = "数值越大衰减越慢，越小衰减越快。";
"Inertia Amount" = "惯性大小";
"Pinch Zoom Speed" = "捏合缩放倍率";
"At 1.0 content zooms exactly as far as your fingers spread. Higher values zoom further for the same spread, so one hand reaches larger sizes." = "1.0 时内容严格跟着手指张合缩放。数值越大，同样的张合放大得越多，单手也能放得更大。";
"Zoom" = "缩放";
"Scales how far scrolling glides after you lift your finger." = "调整抬起手指后滚动滑行的距离。";
"Enable Scroll Inertia to adjust this." = "打开滚动惯性后才能调整。";
"Turn on Magnification under Gestures to adjust this." = "在“手势”里打开缩放后才能调整。";

